 "wl": {
  "id": "gid://shopify/Product/10355444449442",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The watch strap, without the watch. Five rows of polished gold tone links, set like brickwork, make a slim strap about 9mm wide that bends and follows the wrist the way a watch strap does. It is about 17cm long and about 2.5mm thick.</p><p><strong>STYLING TIP:</strong> Wear it where a watch would sit, with the Watch Link Ring, or stack it with the Watch Link Bangle.</p><p><strong>Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Type: Flexible link bracelet; it bends and follows the wrist</li>\n<li>Width: Approximately 9mm</li>\n<li>Thickness: Approximately 2.5mm</li>\n<li>Length: Approximately 17cm</li>\n<li>Links: Five rows of polished links in a brick pattern</li>\n<li>Stones: None</li>\n<li>Closure: Fold over clasp</li>\n<li>Finish: Polished gold tone</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0680/9606/5698/files/watch-link-strap-bracelet-size-guide.jpg\" alt=\"Size guide — Watch Link Strap Bracelet\" width=\"420\"></p><p><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Keep it dry and away from perfume and harsh chemicals. Wipe with a soft dry cloth and store it flat in its pouch.</p><p>You will receive your piece in a Naira Petite box.</p>"
 },
